# Grottle™ core (in-pack code) — v0.15.10
Use only via grottle-gauge. In-bot code: start.py, sandbox_guard.py, guarded_run.py.
**Locked rules v0.15.10 (BCORN approves changes):** Art skin theme covers Sand, SuperGrok™ and Who Ate My Sand? incl. mail; checker verifies. Required readings present + readable; levels from real numbers (volume-correct). No outside code or images in skins. No bar graphs unless the user asks. Studio never says can't: offer to try, preview, check; user decides. Never water down a design (ask first). Sand estimate first; wait for go before any art/image draft. Stop after two failed studio fixes. S4 install list = clickable widget (one button per install + No). Day roll always gives a plain NOTE naming the reset time. Background steps write DONE markers; check before saying still working. Install notes: WAMS/mail need shared logs; Grottle™ contacts a CoS only once the user has chosen one. CHAT NOTE for a mid-week drop names the lane that dropped. Import carries unfinished studio work and re-checks each skin. Ask a fresh Sand % before/after big steps or when stale: once, never nag.

